   "body": "### Motivation\n- Restore the original product line-point consistency defect from the conditioned law used\n  before the pasting step in `lem:qld-xz-lines` (#490).\n- Preserve the exact discarded probability mass rather than assuming its later numerical\n  estimate.\n\n### Description\n- Add `consistencyDefect_le_nondegenerateLinePastingDist_add_discarded_mass` as a\n  formalization-only specialization of the generic finite-conditioning theorem.\n- Relabel the conditioned product samples to `nondegenerateLinePastingDist` using\n  `Distribution.avgOver_map`.\n- Re-export the leaf module from `MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.Lines`.\n\n### Testing\n- `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/Lines/PastingRestoration.lean`\n- `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.Lines.PastingRestoration MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.Lines`\n- Standard-three axiom audit\n- Proof-hole, bypass, whitespace, line-length, hook, and merge-loss checks\n\n---\nCloses #490\n",
