-  "body": "### Motivation\n- Complete the two remaining measurement-algebra targets of #120:\n  `tildeM_isProj` and `sum_tildeM_eq_one`.\n- Source: `references/qpbt-paper/14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex:1416-1438`,\n  Equation `eq:tilde_M`; blueprint `def:tilde-m-measurement` and\n  `lem:tilde-m-projective`.\n\n### Description\n- Prove projectivity by tensor-product projectivity and orthogonality of\n  distinct polynomial marginals. Prove completeness by the scalar bijection\n  `a -> Dec(g) dot u - a` followed by completeness of both factors.\n- Preserve both public signatures, all definitions, and all imports. No\n  additional strategy assumption, decoder bridge, axiom, or proof hole is added.\n- Retain the matching blueprint proof and the statement-integrity audit\n  `audits/2026-09-07_pulled-apart-projectivity-120.md`; append a dated refresh\n  record without rewriting the original construction record.\n- Refresh published PR293 head `dc0ccdc91adf0b5d2b48308e9a20994677f17102`\n  by an ordinary merge of published main\n  `a4b2a792a888027ff457ca2d0bca347e4df28892`, producing refresh commit\n  `f5c9b2c52795c4357fecf0e1e972808a796c0ca6`. Preserve all incoming paths,\n  prior proof content, and raw telemetry. `Extraction/Observables.lean` and\n  the chapter 16 blueprint are preserved; the merged parent provides the reviewed\n  `tauDotProj_mul_eq_zero_of_ne` implementation through the same public API.\n- PR250 / #239 and PR248 / #240 are now merged, at merge commits\n  `98350244e0d3af7e9afb2e1e583acfef327cf03e` and\n  `ae63048fbf2b699b3794afdd412bcabb71e7445e`, respectively. Their proofs supply\n  the other three issue120 targets.\n- **Merge hold: #119 remains open and remains a native dependency of #120.**\n  The dependency graph also retains closed prerequisites #63, #114, #239,\n  and #240. This PR is given-witness measurement algebra: it does not construct\n  `GlobalPairWitness`, claim its source existence theorem, or remove its gate.\n  The four existing swap obligations and issue121's separate work remain\n  outside this change.\n\n### Testing\n- Fresh private Lean artifact output succeeds for `Extraction/Defs.lean` and\n  `Extraction/Observables.lean`. Direct source checks pass for\n  `Extraction/Consistency.lean` and the root `MIPStarRE/QPBT.lean` import.\n  The two target proof holes are removed; the four unrelated swap holes and\n  six consistency holes remain unchanged.\n- All five issue120 target declarations, the merged dot-product orthogonality\n  helper, and both tensor/projector support lemmas have exactly the axiom\n  closure `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`. The targeted\n  `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Extraction.Observables` succeeds, and the axiom and\n  direct-import checks pass again against its refreshed import artifacts.\n- Source-header comparison against both the preceding published PR293 head\n  and the new main base reports no changed public extraction headers.\n  Hole/bypass scans, whitespace checks, and the canonical merge-loss guard pass.\n- Blueprint LaTeX conventions and synchronization pass after regenerating the\n  ignored declaration list with the eight incoming main references.\n  `leanblueprint web` succeeds with existing missing-bibliography warnings,\n  and `lake exe checkdecls blueprint/lean_decls` resolves all generated links.\n- Checked publication uses the primary checkout's workflow scripts. Exact-head\n  full CI and independent review remain separate required integration gates;\n  neither is claimed by this publication session. #119 remains a merge hold\n  even after those gates pass.\n\n---\nCloses #120\n",
