+  "body": "### Motivation\n- Supply the same-space rounding transport needed by `lem:qld-4-7`, QPBT paper section 14, lines 1278-1288, using the proved orthonormalization lemma.\n\n### Description\n- Construct both projective roundings and transport consistency through arbitrary question-dependent outcome maps.\n- Prove the bound `delta + sqrt(220 * delta^(1/4)) + 2 * sqrt(delta + eta)` in both heterogeneous player orientations, without an outcome-cardinality factor.\n- Retain the global-witness construction as a separate proof obligation; no existing paper theorem gains assumptions.\n\n### Testing\n- Author's single-file Lean check passes without warnings, and all six public declarations have only the standard three axioms.\n- No `sorry` or `axiom` matches occur in the new module.\n- Operator publication uses normal hooks and checked push; full exact-head CI and independent review remain subsequent gates.\n\n---\nCloses #278\n",
